sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Clinician as Clinician (Device A)
    participant UI_A as Memory Lab HUD (Device A)
    participant Edge_A as Qdrant Edge (Device A)
    participant Gov_A as Memory Governor / Firewall (Device A)
    participant Cloud as Central Qdrant Server
    participant Edge_B as Qdrant Edge (Device B - Peer)
    actor Clinician_B as Clinician (Device B)

    Note over Clinician,Cloud: STEP 1 & 2: Initial Online Synchronization
    UI_A->>Cloud: Connect to Central Server (Online Baseline)
    Cloud-->>Edge_A: Sync Global Medical Protocols Shard

    Note over Clinician,Edge_A: STEP 3: Network Disappears (Airplane Mode Activated)
    Clinician->>UI_A: Toggle Airplane Mode / Sever Network
    UI_A-->>Clinician: UI updates: [● OFFLINE MODE: 100% Autonomous]

    Note over Clinician,Edge_A: STEP 4 & 5: Offline Semantic Search
    Clinician->>UI_A: Search "acute wheezing and respiratory distress"
    UI_A->>Edge_A: Query In-Process Mutable & Immutable Shards
    Edge_A-->>UI_A: Ranked Candidates returned in <4ms (Zero Network Packets)
    UI_A-->>Clinician: Render Results + Score Attribution Chips

    Note over Clinician,Gov_A: STEP 6, 7 & 8: Ingest New Observation Offline & Governance
    Clinician->>UI_A: Ingest: "Patient tachycardic, HR 125, SpO2 89%"
    UI_A->>Edge_A: Store in Local Mutable Shard (Immediate Persistence)
    UI_A->>Gov_A: Evaluate Retention Score (G_score: 0.82 -> SYNC_CANDIDATE)
    Gov_A-->>UI_A: Enqueue in SQLite Persistent Queue (Status: PENDING)

    Note over Clinician,Cloud: STEP 9, 10, 11 & 12: Network Reconnects & Privacy Scrubbing
    Clinician->>UI_A: Reconnect Network
    UI_A->>Gov_A: Privacy Firewall inspects queued memory
    Gov_A->>Gov_A: Scrub synthetic patient identifiers; retain clinical findings
    Gov_A->>Cloud: Batch Upsert Points (Status: COMMITTED)
    Cloud-->>UI_A: Acknowledge Points Received

    Note over Cloud,Clinician_B: STEP 13 & 14: Peer Device Receives Update via Snapshot
    Cloud->>Cloud: Re-index HNSW and Generate Partial Snapshot Manifest
    Edge_B->>Cloud: Check Manifest -> Download Partial Snapshot Delta
    Edge_B->>Edge_B: Mount New Segments & Update Knowledge Graph
    Clinician_B->>Edge_B: Query Patient History -> New Observation Visible!

    Note over Clinician,UI_A: STEP 15: Provenance Remains Completely Visible
    Clinician->>UI_A: Open Memory Inspector on Observation
    UI_A-->>Clinician: Renders Complete Origin Device, Hashes, and Parent DAG
